1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:07,200
We're going to think about what we want to make today.
来想想今天要做点什么吃。

2
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:17,319
Very good. Okay, next we have our little bowl here.
好啦，接下来先拿出这个小碗。

3
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:20,920
I want to use up this like cottage cheese from yesterday.
我想把昨天剩下的这些茅屋奶酪用完。

4
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:24,439
I really like this brand right here, Good Culture. She's really good.
我很喜欢这个牌子，Good Culture，真的挺好吃。

5
00:00:24,439 --> 00:00:26,600
Once the eggs are done, I'm just going to mix right in here too.
等鸡蛋做好了，我也会把它们混到这里面。

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,840
Since we don't have lime, I'm just going to put honey mustard because honey mustard is good.
因为没有青柠了，我打算加蜂蜜芥末酱，蜂蜜芥末酱很好吃。

7
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:36,280
Okay, I love honey mustard. I mean there's no honey mustard. This is like ground mustard. Whatever. Anyways.
我很喜欢蜂蜜芥末酱。不过，等等，这里没有蜂蜜芥末酱，这个应该是研磨芥末酱。算啦，总之。

8
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:41,559
Okay, that's way too much. Okay, that's a little way too much.
好吧，加太多了，真的有点太多了。

9
00:00:41,559 --> 00:00:44,920
Okay, that's a little scary. I don't know why I did that. It'll be fine.
这看起来有点吓人，我也不知道自己怎么加了这么多，应该没事。

10
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,759
These jumbo blueberries we bought.
还有我们买的这些大颗蓝莓。

11
00:00:46,759 --> 00:00:50,280
I literally got three other stacks of like blueberries I need to eat.
我其实还有三份蓝莓等着吃呢。

12
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:56,910
But yeah, I'm going to eat the most recent one cuz I want to get some strawberries, so we're just going to wash these up.
不过，我先吃最近买的这份，再拿点草莓，先把它们洗一下。

13
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:01,840
Tiny little pickles or big ass pickle? Sour.
选小小的酸黄瓜，还是一个特别大的？好酸。

14
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:06,360
Maybe next time I should just spray oil on top of it.
也许下次我应该在上面喷一点油。

15
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:11,150
Do you hear it? She's so crisp.
听见了吗？这个好脆。

16
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:14,790
Okay, wait, that is so much better to peel.
等等，这样剥起来好多了。

17
00:01:14,790 --> 00:01:15,830
I have two eggs.
我有两个鸡蛋。

18
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:19,990
I'm glad that I'm like actually cooking stuff now cuz this is so nice to cook for myself.
我挺高兴自己现在真的开始做饭了，给自己做饭的感觉真好。

19
00:01:19,990 --> 00:01:23,500
So my little iced coffee on the side. So we're just going to bring this over now.
旁边再放一杯冰咖啡，现在把这些端过去。

20
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:26,310
Oh my God, y'all, that's so good.
天哪，这个真好吃。

21
00:01:26,350 --> 00:01:28,660
It turns out I still crave Thai food. Food.
结果我还是想吃泰餐，特别想吃。

22
00:01:28,670 --> 00:01:34,989
And there was actually a place that was right there, but then it felt like a bar sort of situation, and I felt like it was going to be really loud inside.
附近其实就有一家，但感觉有点像酒吧，我觉得里面可能会很吵。

23
00:01:34,989 --> 00:01:39,390
I want to go here. Let me show you this one. It's called Chada NYC. I've never been here.
我想去这里，给你们看看，叫 Chada NYC，我还没来过。

24
00:01:39,390 --> 00:01:41,560
I forgot my mic.
我忘带麦克风了。

25
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:47,629
I got a Thai iced coffee.
我点了一杯泰式冰咖啡。

26
00:01:47,629 --> 00:01:51,869
I was, I usually get a Thai iced tea, but I thought that I needed a bit more caffeine.
我平时通常点泰式冰茶，不过今天觉得自己需要多一点咖啡因。

27
00:01:51,869 --> 00:01:57,950
So I ordered a crispy tofu, mango sticky rice, and I ordered a taro furter.
所以我点了脆豆腐、芒果糯米饭，还有一个芋头炸物。

28
00:01:57,950 --> 00:02:01,830
I was going to order a pan curry, but they only have it with meat, so …
本来还想点一份咖喱，但这道只有带肉的版本，所以就算了。

29
00:02:13,790 --> 00:02:16,189
So crispy and so soft on inside.
外面好脆，里面又好软。

30
00:02:16,189 --> 00:02:20,580
They come with a little sauce on the center.
中间还配了一点酱。

31
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:29,299
I always think of taro as sweet, but the sauce makes it salty, but taro tasted very strong.
我总觉得芋头应该是甜口的，但这个酱让它变成咸口，芋头本身的味道也很浓。

32
00:02:29,309 --> 00:02:32,590
She's not as ripe, you know. She's a bit still a bit hard, which is fine.
这个还没有那么熟，吃起来有点硬，不过也可以。

33
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:36,749
The rice is a bit more firm. I usually like when my rice a bit more mushy, so …
米饭稍微硬一点，我通常更喜欢软糯一些的，所以……

34
00:02:36,749 --> 00:02:38,989
But out of all these, this one has to be my favorite.
不过，这些里面，我最喜欢的肯定是这个。

35
00:02:38,989 --> 00:02:44,110
This is one my favorite fried tofu because a lot of the ones I've had, the shell is very very crunchy.
这算是我最喜欢的炸豆腐之一，因为以前吃过的很多，外壳都特别硬脆。

36
00:02:44,110 --> 00:02:50,979
But the inside of this one, like, let me just show you, inside is literally still kind of like pudding, which is kind of crazy.
但这个里面，给你们看看，竟然还是像布丁一样，太神奇了。

37
00:02:51,019 --> 00:02:54,940
Next I'm going to put some onion on top. Put you on top.
接下来在上面放点洋葱，放到上面去。

38
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:57,820
I think this will be fine. It will taste amazing.
我觉得这样应该可以，吃起来一定很棒。

39
00:02:57,820 --> 00:03:00,620
Should I put cheese on top? You know what, yeah, we need cheese.
要不要再放点奶酪？好吧，当然要，得有奶酪。

40
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:03,019
Salsa. We don't want too much.
再加点莎莎酱，别放太多。

41
00:03:03,019 --> 00:03:15,580
And then we need pickle and sparkling water.
然后还需要酸黄瓜和气泡水。

42
00:03:20,060 --> 00:03:26,540
Finish everything, but this pickle is just, I don't know. Maybe this pickle is just too sour. It's not very crunchy.
别的都吃完了，不过这个酸黄瓜，我也说不好，可能就是太酸了，而且不太脆。
